  "bodyHash": "48b29fe5d96ca948",
  "content": "<h4>Gravelmon 是一个为热门模组 Cobblemon 开发的附加模组，旨在将来自您喜爱的粉丝游戏和 ROM 破解版中的经典、标志性或具有历史意义的虚构宝可梦带入 Minecraft！</h4>\n<p>目前，该模组添加了 205 个模型化的虚构宝可梦和 4000 多个公告板风格的虚构宝可梦！</p>\n<h3>为什么采用公告板实现方式？</h3>\n<p>当我们最终着手制作虚构宝可梦的模型时，使用公告板风格的虚构宝可梦可以节省时间，因为我们不需要为每个新添加的宝可梦逐个编写 Json 文件。这样我们就可以对已实现的虚构宝可梦进行玩法测试，并轻松地为现有的虚构宝可梦添加模型。</p>\n<h3>我不希望游戏中出现任何公告板风格的内容，这有可能吗？</h3>\n<p>是的，我们为支持 Gravelmon 而创建的库模组（Gravel's Extended Battles）支持黑名单标签功能。默认情况下，“not_modeled”标签被列入黑名单，因此公告板风格的实现不会在游戏中显示。如果您希望启用公告板内容，只需在 gravelmon 配置的黑名单中移除“not_modeled”标签即可。</p>\n<p>本包中包含的所有模型化虚构宝可梦都拥有闪光形态，并且为其没有闪光形态的原作游戏添加了自定义闪光形态。</p>\n<h4>该模组目前处于重度开发阶段，尚不完整。想要提供帮助吗？欢迎加入 Discord，那里可以找到关于模型提交的说明。如果您有任何问题，也可以在那里提问。</h4>\n<h3>目前包含以下虚构宝可梦来源：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fpkmnafricanus%253flang%253den\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Africanvs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.pokecommunity.com%252fthreads%252fpokemon-azure-act-2-released.460525%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Azure</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokemon-blazing-emerald.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fPokemon_Blazing_Emerald_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Blazing Emerald</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Chaos in Vesita</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Daybreak</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Deneb/Vega</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokémon Forêt Éternelle</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpkmnflux.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fMain_Page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Flux</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpinfinity.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fPokemon_Infinity_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Infinity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.p-insurgence.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Insurgence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokengine.org%252fcollections%252f102c91de%252fAzurite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Azurite</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokengine.org%252fcollections%252f10pt9pyv%252fKuulkid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kuulkid Collection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lockemon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokengine.org%252fcollections%252f10byuotj%252fMidamis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Midamis Collection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokengine.org%252fcollections%252f10o0ctrn%252fMikitari\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mikitari Collection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokengine.org%252fcollections%252f107s7x9x%252fMongratis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mongratis Collection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokengine.org%252fcollections%252f105q17p6%252fNodorro\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nodorro Collection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokengine.org%252fcollections%252f10togncw%252fNorheim\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Norheim Collection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokengine.org%252fcollections%252f10s2nypf%252fOceane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oceane Collection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokengine.org%252fcollections%252f103bhnos%252fOlysos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Olysos Collection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flostiefangames.blogspot.com%252fp%252fpokemon-opalo.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Opalo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.pokecommunity.com%252fthreads%252fphoenix-rising.425404%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Phoenix Rising</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Realidea System</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokengine.org%252fcollections%252f10hvquu7%252fRica\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rica Collection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Sage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Radical Red</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.pokecommunity.com%252fthreads%252fpokemon-soulstones-postgame-released.440329%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Soulstones</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokemonworkshop.com%252fen%252fgames%252fpokemon-umbra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Umbra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokemon-uranium.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fMain_Page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Uranium</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.pokecommunity.com%252fthreads%252fproject-vanguard-updated-12-11-24.438886%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Vanguard</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokengine.org%252fcollections%252f10piq9nx%252fVaritas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Varitas Collection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.weedleteam.com%252fwp%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemon Xenoverse</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>免责声明：\n新增的虚构宝可梦均已获得所有者许可。</p>\n<h3>加入 Discord 以获取文档并了解最新开发动态！</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/yBshG9wVe8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/yBshG9wVe8</a></p>\n<h3>服务器管理员重要通知</h3>\n<p>您被允许在服务器上使用此模组，但 Gravelmon 有一项政策，禁止将此模组或其任何内容置于付费墙后，或以任何形式出售其内容以换取现实世界的货币或通过现实世界货币购买的货币。如果您发现某服务器存在此类行为，请向我们和 Mojang 举报。</p>",
